{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><p>### 100-2. Saraṇaduka-vedanāttikaṃ ^7-49-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-49a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30224.41986095365\">8:23:44</span> 1. Saraṇaṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-49a-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30235.603890904727\">8:23:55</span> Araṇaṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30246.22273104635\">8:24:06</span> 2. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… kamme dve, vipāke ekaṃ…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi sabbattha vitthāretabbā). ^7-49a-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30256.77603699714\">8:24:16</span> 3. Saraṇaṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-49a-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30267.955981185965\">8:24:27</span> Saraṇaṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30280.024569911307\">8:24:40</span> 4. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-49a-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30289.574232951363\">8:24:49</span> 5. Saraṇaṃ adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-49a-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30301.896358243186\">8:25:01</span> Araṇaṃ adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30314.583029268935\">8:25:14</span> 6. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-49a-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30324.483603014305\">8:25:24</span> Saraṇadukavedanāttikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-3. Saraṇaduka-vipākattikaṃ ^7-49b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-49c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30332.350758756813\">8:25:32</span> 7. Araṇaṃ vipākaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo vipāko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49c-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30343.586911214577\">8:25:43</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30353.09206894564\">8:25:53</span> 8. Saraṇaṃ vipākadhammadhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo vipākadhammadhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-49c-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30360.770428845506\">8:26:00</span> Araṇaṃ vipākadhammadhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo vipākadhammadhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30368.248676117302\">8:26:08</span> 9. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-49c-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30376.766959065804\">8:26:16</span> Araṇaṃ nevavipākanavipākadhammadhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo nevavipākanavipākadhammadhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30392.34408191131\">8:26:32</span> 10. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ). ^7-49c-10</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-4. Saraṇaduka-upādinnattikaṃ ^7-49d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-49e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30402.33535600858\">8:26:42</span> 11. Araṇaṃ upādinnupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo upādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49e-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30415.540972934195\">8:26:55</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30425.525651968528\">8:27:05</span> 12. Saraṇaṃ anupādinnupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-49e-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30435.90128414019\">8:27:15</span> Araṇaṃ anupādinnupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>Saraṇaṃ anupādinnupādāniyañca araṇaṃ anupādinnupādāniyañca dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo anupādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30446.18715580259\">8:27:26</span> 13. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-49e-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30456.45595609155\">8:27:36</span> 14. Araṇaṃ anupādinnaanupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo anupādinnaanupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49e-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30467.485049988554\">8:27:47</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-5. Saraṇaduka-saṃkiliṭṭhattikaṃ ^7-49f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-49g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30477.593427794007\">8:27:57</span> 15. Saraṇaṃ saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49g-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30491.611981925613\">8:28:11</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30501.536161045777\">8:28:21</span> 16. Araṇaṃ asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49g-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30511.747049034333\">8:28:31</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30521.611234997137\">8:28:41</span> 17. Araṇaṃ asaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo asaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49g-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30532.121362163078\">8:28:52</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-6. Saraṇaduka-vitakkattikaṃ ^7-49h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-49i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30542.20482627752\">8:29:02</span> 18. Saraṇaṃ savitakkasavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo savitakkasavicāro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-49i-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30555.10551902575\">8:29:15</span> Araṇaṃ savitakkasavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo savitakkasavicāro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30564.78539528324\">8:29:24</span> 19. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-49i-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30573.592738271796\">8:29:33</span> 20. Araṇaṃ avitakkavicāramattaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo avitakkavicāramatto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49i-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30584.11602122316\">8:29:44</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30592.581897042914\">8:29:52</span> 21. Araṇaṃ avitakkaavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo avitakkaavicāro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49i-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30602.07396480545\">8:30:02</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ (sabbattha ekaṃ)…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-7. Saraṇaduka-pītittikaṃ ^7-49j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-49k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30606.95811014591\">8:30:06</span> 22. Saraṇaṃ pītisahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo pītisahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-49k-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30617.857735329017\">8:30:17</span> Araṇaṃ pītisahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo pītisahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30626.43736490845\">8:30:26</span> 23. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi sabbattha vitthāretabbā). ^7-49k-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30636.974932908448\">8:30:36</span> 24. Saraṇaṃ sukhasahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo sukhasahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-49k-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30648.33516621744\">8:30:48</span> Araṇaṃ sukhasahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo sukhasahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30656.943731925614\">8:30:56</span> 25. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi vitthāretabbā). ^7-49k-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30666.013784871255\">8:31:06</span> 26. Saraṇaṃ upekkhāsahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo upekkhāsahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-49k-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30675.24324214019\">8:31:15</span> Araṇaṃ upekkhāsahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo upekkhāsahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30684.43573831471\">8:31:24</span> 27. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi vitthāretabbo). ^7-49k-27</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-8. Saraṇaduka-dassanenapahātabbattikaṃ ^7-49l-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-49m-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30693.19694789128\">8:31:33</span> 28. Saraṇaṃ dassanena pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo dassanena pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49m-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30706.44300685409\">8:31:46</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30716.403018728204\">8:31:56</span> 29. Saraṇaṃ bhāvanāya pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo bhāvanāya pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49m-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30726.016135214577\">8:32:06</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30735.627566203133\">8:32:15</span> 30. Araṇaṃ nevadassanena nabhāvanāya pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo nevadassanena nabhāvanāya pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. ^7-49m-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30748.524971871255\">8:32:28</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ (sabbattha ekaṃ)…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-9. Saraṇaduka-dassanenapahātabbahetukattikaṃ ^7-49n-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-49o-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30752.174495017167\">8:32:32</span> 31. Saraṇaṃ dassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo dassanena pahātabbahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49o-31</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30762.939423908447\">8:32:42</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30773.085032908446\">8:32:53</span> 32. Saraṇaṃ bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo bhāvanāya pahātabbahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49o-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30783.801715185968\">8:33:03</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30793.796868154495\">8:33:13</span> 33. Saraṇaṃ nevadassanena nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo nevadassanena nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49o-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30808.90336602861\">8:33:28</span> Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe ekaṃ. (Sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-10. Saraṇaduka-ācayagāmittikaṃ ^7-49p-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-49q-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30816.400710991416\">8:33:36</span> 34. Saraṇaṃ ācayagāmiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo ācayagāmī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-49q-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30827.671656\">8:33:47</span> Araṇaṃ ācayagāmiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo ācayagāmī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30840.655900785423\">8:34:00</span> 35. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha vitthāretabbo.) ^7-49q-35</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30850.186594922754\">8:34:10</span> 36. Araṇaṃ apacayagāmiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo apacayagāmī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49q-36</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30859.126515091553\">8:34:19</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30868.666229934195\">8:34:28</span> 37. Araṇaṃ nevācayagāmināpacayagāmiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo nevācayagāmināpacayagāmī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49q-37</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30881.280373171663\">8:34:41</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) (Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100-11. Saraṇaduka-sekkhattikaṃ ^7-49r-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-49s-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30891.323132177382\">8:34:51</span> 38. Araṇaṃ sekkhaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo sekkho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-49s-38</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30901.93042892275\">8:35:01</span